<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Fruits</title>
	<style>
		body {
			background-color: #f9ffe6;
			margin: 0;
			font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
			color: #333;
		}

		header {
			background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6f61, #ffcc33);
			padding: 20px 0;
			text-align: center;
			color: white;
			font-size: 2.5em;
			letter-spacing: 2px;
			font-weight: bold;
			text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
		}

		p {
			color: darkgreen;
			font-size: 18px;
			font-style: italic;
			line-height: 1.6;
			padding: 20px;
			text-align: justify;
		}

		ul {
			list-style-type: none;
			padding: 0;
			margin: 20px auto;
			width: fit-content;
		}

		ul li {
			font-size: 20px;
			font-weight: bold;
			margin: 8px 0;
			padding: 8px 16px;
			border-radius: 8px;
			transition: 0.3s;
			cursor: pointer;
		}

		#li1 { color: red; background-color: #ffe6e6; }
		#li2 { color: orange; background-color: #fff2e0; }
		#li3 { color: limegreen; background-color: #e9ffe6; }
		#li4 { color: purple; background-color: #f4e6ff; }

		ul li:hover {
			transform: scale(1.05);
			box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
		}

		table {
			border-collapse: collapse;
			width: 60%;
			margin: 30px auto;
			box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
			border-radius: 10px;
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		th, td {
			padding: 12px 16px;
			text-align: left;
		}

		th {
			background-color: #6a1b9a;
			color: white;
			font-size: 18px;
		}

		tr:nth-child(even) {
			background-color: #f9f2ff;
		}

		tr:hover {
			background-color: #e1bee7;
		}

		footer {
			background-color: #6a1b9a;
			color: white;
			text-align: center;
			padding: 15px 0;
			font-size: 16px;
			margin-top: 40px;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			table {
				width: 90%;
			}
			header {
				font-size: 2em;
			}
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>

	<header>🍎 FRUITS 🍇</header>

	<p>
		Fruits are nature’s sweet and nutritious gifts, packed with vitamins, minerals, and fiber that help keep our bodies healthy.
		They come in a wide variety of colors, flavors, and textures—from the juicy sweetness of mangoes and oranges to the crisp freshness of apples and pears.
		Eating a variety of fruits every day can boost the immune system, improve digestion, and provide natural energy.
		Whether enjoyed fresh, blended into smoothies, or added to salads and desserts, fruits are an essential part of a balanced diet and a delicious way to stay healthy.
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li id="li1">🍎 APPLE</li>
		<li id="li2">🍊 ORANGE</li>
		<li id="li3">🍌 BANANA</li>
		<li id="li4">🍇 GRAPES</li>
		<li>🥭 MANGO</li>
	</ul>

	<table>
		<thead>
			<tr>
				<th>Reg No</th>
				<th>Name</th>
				<th>Marks</th>
			</tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody>
			<tr><td>1234</td><td>Nia</td><td>98</td></tr>
			<tr><td>4343</td><td>Lee</td><td>95</td></tr>
			<tr><td>3663</td><td>Zia</td><td>88</td></tr>
			<tr><td>1122</td><td>Ria</td><td>78</td></tr>
		</tbody>
	</table>

	<footer>
		© 2025 Fruits World | Designed with ❤️ by You
	</footer>

</body>
</html>
